red:true, recorded:[]` on pre-fix 21a5 with four false checks and passes 28/28 on ba7690a; all 11 maintenance oracles pass; the six related suites pass 55/55; `tsc -b` and the public-API baseline pass. Limit: this makes the product's refreshed record name one new delivery correctly; it does not make a fixed executor call `conclude`, does not accept or promote anything, and leaves the canonical head and operator authority unchanged.\",\"artifacts\":[\"src/deployment/direct_delivery_guard.ts\",\"src/project_continuity/episode.ts\",\"test/pnwf_direct_guard.test.ts\",\"scripts/pnwf/software/self-maintenance-delivery-record.mjs\",\"scripts/pnwf/software/self-maintenance-late-guard.mjs\",\"scripts/pnwf/software/self-maintenance-prepared-ref.mjs\",\"scripts/pnwf/software/self-maintenance-sealed-guard.mjs\"],\"waitingOn\":null,\"nextStep\":null,\"evidenceRefs\":[],\"recordedAt\":\"2026-11-22T02:54:21.951Z\",\"basis\":{\"projectRevision\":0,\"projectDigest\":\"5db35f67c7c6a11ce56a22ae94462b7569df339601df4971c0ed4ecb3f4a9cc1\",\"headCommit\":\"082f77a9a4602d1eb5a2d9be1260186fa41c4a61\"},\"check\":{\"deliveryBlockers\":[],\"awaitingOperator\":[],\"openTasks\":[],\"openAttempts\":[],\"unresolvedQuestions\":[\"journal:pje-d7ec3525f099e1c4c99063d5f9f9da9c\",\"journal:pje-537a0a96f9b52372cb69debe22de780d\"],\"blockedEffects\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"path\":\"src/deployment/direct_delivery_guard.ts\",\"present\":true,\"tracked\":true,\"committed\":true,\"digest\":\"5ed16e49b361e45c9da1655c17665a2725ec67eb6a97179a915ab65108eb512c\",\"source\":\"WORKTREE\",\"commit\":\"ba7690ab3da6adc7702050063de1d71dc10e1bb3\",\"detail\":\"committed at HEAD\"},{\"path\":\"src/project_continuity/episode.ts\",\"present\":true,\"tracked\":true,\"committed\":true,\"digest\":\"78c3532523b86768a5bf91c6c6d16fa5f7e9920d11f0dc1d7ec34f542b3af6bb\",\"source\":\"WORKTREE\",\"commit\":\"ba7690ab3da6adc7702050063de1d71dc10e1bb3\",\"detail\":\"committed at HEAD\"},{\"path\":\"test/pnwf_direct_guard.test.ts\",\"presen